d/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1984992, "client_id": 2516108, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e4b06b7f/uploads/origins/73a96cc2-be7e-4131-b6ce-4fc3b3e7abac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ff1421ecd02b4cf5eb64edaf12c21be", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e4b06b7f/uploads/origins/73a96cc2-be7e-4131-b6ce-4fc3b3e7abac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ff1421ecd02b4cf5eb64edaf12c21be, https://si.imgix.net/e4b06b7f/uploads/origins/73a96cc2-be7e-4131-b6ce-4fc3b3e7abac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de3ae49859737ec84afa79d5c1adff16 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e4b06b7f/uploads/origins/73a96cc2-be7e-4131-b6ce-4fc3b3e7abac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f8f5238330aa77da91815ae6bf7a525 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e4b06b7f/uploads/origins/73a96cc2-be7e-4131-b6ce-4fc3b3e7abac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3b7322125300dd53b0bf5024743bdd9f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e4b06b7f/uploads/origins/73a96cc2-be7e-4131-b6ce-4fc3b3e7abac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3b7322125300dd53b0bf5024743bdd9f, https://si.imgix.net/e4b06b7f/uploads/origins/73a96cc2-be7e-4131-b6ce-4fc3b3e7abac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d2f01aab67d9427a3db8811f49e4032a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e4b06b7f/uploads/origins/73a96cc2-be7e-4131-b6ce-4fc3b3e7abac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=da49f98904dc510918f3f40f6c67a438 3x"}, "body": "안녕하세요! vtuber 天櫻咲樂 생일 아트를 의뢰하고 싶습니다. 원하시면 그녀의 옷 디자인을 변경하실 수 있습니다. 배경에 별이 빛나는 밤하늘에 그녀를 두고 싶습니다. 얼굴 표정, 자세와 같은 다른 모든 세부 사항은 전적으로 귀하에게 달려 있습니다. 이 아트워크는 그녀의 스트림과 커버에 사용될 수 있습니다. 귀하의 격려에 감사드립니다.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/10Pl9XtUsw14PPNhnqE5xj_rNwm7ahIZm/view?usp=drive_link", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ritone_synd/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1984992, "client_id": 510885, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f7fe2356/uploads/origins/d09046c6-ab3c-403e-950b-c8cde8abe88e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4624309e056b87d5639e676d4f2921d5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f7fe2356/uploads/origins/d09046c6-ab3c-403e-950b-c8cde8abe88e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4624309e056b87d5639e676d4f2921d5, https://si.imgix.net/f7fe2356/uploads/origins/d09046c6-ab3c-403e-950b-c8cde8abe88e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a93242c5762daec0938e126e4bc9c1bf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f7fe2356/uploads/origins/d09046c6-ab3c-403e-950b-c8cde8abe88e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a3544a616cefef084a4ae39d93300eb6 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f7fe2356/uploads/origins/d09046c6-ab3c-403e-950b-c8cde8abe88e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2f9b00fc8850eec8ba3ea0fdc5d931b5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f7fe2356/uploads/origins/d09046c6-ab3c-403e-950b-c8cde8abe88e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2f9b00fc8850eec8ba3ea0fdc5d931b5, https://si.imgix.net/f7fe2356/uploads/origins/d09046c6-ab3c-403e-950b-c8cde8abe88e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ec9a93236b3d9e89adcc81bf